WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.180
You can sew almost anything into the canvas of a coat.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.180
When I was a boy, I started to hide things in the linings of the garments.

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.320
Things that only I knew were there.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:21.880
Oh!

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:24.900
Secrets.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.320
Good morning.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:28.640
Will you have dinner with me?

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:32.860
Yes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.660
I feel as if I've been looking for you for a very long time.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.540
You look beautiful.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.860
Very beautiful.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:45.820
I have things I want to do.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.500
Things I cannot simply do without you.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:52.400
Reynolds has made my dreams come true.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.980
And I have given him what he desires most in return.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.880
Every piece of me.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.180
Why are you not married?

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.240
[Laughs]

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:14.880
Her arrival has cast a very long shadow.

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:17.200
She's barely looked at you this evening, has she?

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.700
May I warn you of something?

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.440
My brother can feel cursed.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:24.500
That love is doomed for him.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.060
I don't like the fabric.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:28.700
Maybe one day you'll change your taste.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.340
Maybe I like my own taste.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:31.980
Just enough to get you into trouble.

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.320
Perhaps I'm looking for trouble.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:33.900
Stop!

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.780
There is an air of quiet death in this house.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.700
You're not cursed. You're loved by me.

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.720
Stop playing this game.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:42.440
What game?

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.840
What precisely is the nature of my game?

00:01:45.420 --> 00:01:48.240
All your rules and your clothes and all this money.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.440
And everything's a game.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.400
This was an ambush.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:50.900
Stop.

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.760
Have you been sent here to ruin my evening?

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:54.960
And possibly my entire life?

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.640
Stop it!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.680
Whatever you do

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.180
 

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.420
Do it carefully.

